# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CUSTOMER DATA — not versioned by default.
#
# The restore point and any exported book contain REAL account names and notes
# for a live book of business. This repo has no remote today, but a repo that
# holds customer data is one `gh repo create --public` away from disclosing it,
# and that mistake is not reversible.
#
# If you decide you want your book versioned locally, delete the line below —
# but then never add a remote you do not control, and never make it public.
# Regular Export JSON to a private backup location is the better habit; git is
# for the code, not for a dataset that changes every day inside localStorage.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
book-of-business-RESTORE-POINT-*.json
book-of-business-export*.json
*-export.json

# Screen recordings and screenshots — 46 MB of session artefacts, not project
# files. Git stores binaries whole on every change; these would bloat the
# history permanently and can never be pruned without rewriting it.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif

# The API key lives in the browser's localStorage and never touches this folder.
# These patterns exist so it stays that way if anything ever writes one out.
.env
*.key
*secret*
*apikey*

# Claude Code tooling. .claude/skills/ is 6.2 MB of vendored third-party design
# skills (hallmark, impeccable, taste, ui-ux-pro-max, frontend-design) that are
# updated independently of this project — 302 of the 318 files in the first
# staging attempt. settings.local.json is local by definition. Neither is part of
# the tracker, and both would swamp the history of a repo whose real content is
# two HTML files.
.claude/

# OS and editor noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Workiva-internal documents (hand-off templates, graduation criteria, Gainsight
# field lists, CSM hand-over examples) dropped in for research sessions. Company
# material, same rule as customer data: read in place, never versioned.
docs/research/internal/

# tools/inspect.mjs capture output — instrumentation artefacts (text/png/json
# dumps of rendered views), not project files.
.artifacts/

# Connector local secrets and push log (never commit)
connector/config.json
connector/token.txt
connector/fake-gainsight-log.jsonl
connector/proof.json
connector/gainsight-tokens.json
connector/sent-record.json
connector/dry-run.jsonl
connector/*.tmp
connector/*.lock
.ledger/
